        "original_id": "8c6da4d8-89c7-5247-b318-5474ac5c818b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Topics: United States history, Native American history, colonial period, prehistory\n- People: Native Americans, Paleo-Indians\n- Places: United States, the Americas\n- Organizations: American schools, universities\n\nFacts:\n- The history of Native Americans in the United States began in ancient times tens of thousands of years ago with the settlement of the Americas by the Paleo-Indians.\n- In recent decades, American schools and universities have typically shifted history coverage further back in time to include more on the colonial period and much more on the prehistory of Native Americans.",
